## DESCRIPTION
## Smooth manifolds and implicit form
## ENDDESCRIPTION

## DBsubject('Calculus - multivariable')
## DBchapter('Differentiation of multivariable functions')
## DBsection('Smooth manifolds and implicit form')

DOCUMENT();

loadMacros("PGstandard.pl", "PGML.pl", "MathObjects.pl", "PGchoicemacros.pl");

TEXT(beginproblem());

$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;

$mc = new_checkbox_multiple_choice();
$mc -> qa(
"Which of the following are equivalent to this assumption?", "The matrix \(DF(p)\) has rank \(k\).", "The vectors \(\{ \nabla F_1(p), \dots, \nabla F_k(p) \}\) are linearly independent.", "The vectors \(\{ \partial_1 F(p), \dots, \partial_k F(p) \}\) are linearly independent."
);
$mc -> makeLast(
"The matrix \(DF(p)\) has rank \(k\).", "The linear map \(dF_p\) is injective.", "The linear map \(dF_p\) is surjective.", "The vectors \(\{ \nabla F_1(p), \dots, \nabla F_k(p) \}\) are linearly independent.", "The vectors \(\{ \partial_1 F(p), \dots, \partial_k F(p) \}\) are linearly independent."
);

BEGIN_PGML


Theorem A generalizes to any set defined implicitly by any [` C^1 `] map.

---

    *Theorem B.* _Fix [` k,n \in \mathbb{N}^+ `] with [` k<n `]. Let [` U \subseteq \mathbb{R}^n `] be open and let [` F: U \to \mathbb{R}^{k} `] be a [` C^1 `] map. Assume the set [` S = F^{-1}(\{0\}) `] is non-empty.  Fix [` p \in S `]. If the differential [` dF_p `] has full rank, then [` S `] is a [` (n-k) `]-dimensional smooth manifold at [` p `]. Moreover, the tangent space to [` S `] at [` p `] is a [` (n-k) `]-dimensional subspace of [` \mathbb{R}^n `] given by_

>>[` T_p S = \ker dF_p = \{ v \in \mathbb{R}^n:  DF(p) v = 0 \} `].<<

---

This theorem is quite powerful.

Fill in the blanks.

    _Let [` S `] be a level set of a [` C^1 `] function [` F: \mathbb{R}^{237} \to \mathbb{R}^{137} `]. Fix [` p \in S `]._

    _If [` \mathrm{rank} dF_p = `] [________]{Real(137)},  then [` T_pS `] is a subspace of [` \mathbb{R}^{237} `] of dimension [________]{Real(100)}._
	
Keep the notation of Theorem B. The core assumption is that the differential [` dF_p `] has full rank. [@ $mc -> print_q() @]*

[@ $mc -> print_a() @]*
END_PGML

ANS( checkbox_cmp( $mc->correct_ans() ) );

ENDDOCUMENT();